+     Replaces mediaserver.asp (no longer shipped; httpd bounces its URL here); same nvram, same apply:
        daapd_enable, daapd_friendly_name            iTunes / DAAP (mt-daapd; serves dms_dir, not the list below)
        dms_enable, dms_friendly_name, dms_rebuild    DLNA (minidlna); rebuild 1 = full rebuild at start (-R)
        dms_web                                       minidlna status page on dms_port
diff --git a/release/src/router/www/Reaper_Samba.asp b/release/src/router/www/Reaper_Samba.asp
index 724e8084f36..aeb6f2edd15 100644
