 <!-- Reaper_Samba.asp - USB Application > Network Place (Samba) Share (Reaper-native UI, USB wave, 2026-11-03).
-     Replaces Advanced_AiDisk_samba.asp (still shipped until the owner has reviewed this page); same nvram, same
+     Replaces Advanced_AiDisk_samba.asp (no longer shipped; httpd bounces its URL here); same nvram, same
